e":"pirates","dx":51,"x":246.1,"y":621.6,"cell":69623,"i":291,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1188.3,"y":541.8,"cell":60024,"i":292,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":303.9,"y":822.2,"cell":79900,"i":293,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":337.1,"y":798,"cell":78949,"i":294,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":156.12,"y":819.12,"cell":79748,"i":295,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1270.14,"y":567.69,"cell":63708,"i":296,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1670.5,"y":523.67,"cell":57912,"i":297,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":354.74,"y":234.16,"cell":11474,"i":298,"name":"Tonkher Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༆༜༑༾༺༷༽༻༓༜༨༤༜༪༧༁༔༲༒༧༛༂༷༤༮༜༉༿༹༑༤༆༻ༀ༨༨༳༃༿༌༧༬༻༾༡༣༫༦༹༚༾༙༖༱༡༣༶༆༮༪༷༚༷༛༒༕༡༴༄༒༱༲༔༰༄༶</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1508.65,"y":936.64,"cell":90413,"i":299,"name":"Kaana Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">  ነወሰነደሠገበፈ ሀሀ ዐቀሰ ሀዘቀከደፀረወሐጰፀ ረበደፐወቀተኀነፀከዘለሀመዘለሐ ረፐየጸኀ ፈለረተጠኀለፈጠሀ ለሠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1212.76,"y":613.93,"cell":69201,"i":300,"name":"Bagninanone Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc27\ud802𐠋  \udc0b\udc22\udc27\udc0c\udc04𐠑\ud802𐠫\udc17\ud802𐠣𐠎\udc3c\udc17\udc0e\udc1b𐠼\udc01\ud802 \udc16\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc1d𐠟\udc24𐠞\udc1c\udc03\udc1a𐠗 \udc0e\udc1a\udc32\udc26\ud802\ud802𐠙\ud802𐠯\ud802𐠞\ud802\ud802𐠷\ud802\ud802𐠳𐠋\udc0b\udc33 \udc0c𐠖\udc01\udc12\ud802\ud802𐠸</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":264.46,"y":565.85,"cell":63562,"i":301,"name":"Jingzhou Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፐመፀሠበፈገኀበ መተጰሐተሐአጠሠለፈጠበፐሐጰገፀለፀ ሀ የገኀየሠጸሀየ ሰየነዘተተፐለ ፈለረጸከሀዘ ሰሐሀጰሰቀመደተመጸ ተ ቀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1661.17,"y":518.2,"cell":57114,"i":302,"name":"Bhegh Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡀᠻᠼᡠᠧᡰ᠑ᢐᠧᡙᠱᡱᠽᠩᢡᢤᡀᡞᢥᡙᡳᡁᡝᠭᡓ᠀ᠱᡑᡎᡙᡮᠭᢢᢋᠠᠵᢤᢓᢋᢑᢓᡒᠭᡑᡮᡝᢓᡓᢛᡳᠽᢢᢋᢦᢂ᠒ᡑᡠᢁᠩᡡᠠᢤᡡᡟᠭᢂᡜᡀᡱᡀᡯᠭᢠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1668.62,"y":357.41,"cell":27219,"i":303,"name":"Ek'theilanena Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠂𐠬 \ud802𐠖\udc0e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\ud802𐠍\ud802𐠕𐠔\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍 \udc17\udc05\udc23\udc34\udc13\udc1f\ud802𐠫𐠳\udc1d 𐠊\ud802𐠭\udc0f\udc12\ud802𐠩\udc27\udc31\udc30\udc22\udc0f\udc1c\udc34\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":338.3,"y":817.94,"cell":79782,"i":304,"name":"Vopnafjord Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀበዐሀቀወነገሐሠ ነ ጸለወጸኀዘሠጰ አሐ ወፐገለሐወከቀገ ሰአፈጠኀጠገፐፈ ፀገቀወፀተጰረበፀሐወኀጰሐፐገዘለፀፈጰለጰዐወበወ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1672.65,"y":315.86,"cell":19909,"i":305,"name":"Llurthashe Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༮༦༿༜༯༠༘༾༊༿༔༧༆༹༘༦༾༵༚༧༮༁་ༀ༷༻༯༗༇༭༗༧༆༳༲༩༙༿༯༢༪་༅༨༳༘༧ༀ༿༣༤</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":284.36,"y":894.14,"cell":86271,"i":306,"name":"Muong Tho Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከከረመወሐኀደለበነለረሀ ፀ ሠ ከ ሐዐጰ ዘፐ ሰተሀጰፀከመጰሀሠተፐ  ፈሰለነሠአጸ መለኀለዐጰተፀፈፈወለ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":490.3,"y":1052.78,"cell":100090,"i":307,"name":"Hamakan Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡡᠿᠻᠩᡝᡐᢁᠰᡖᡏᠳᠿᢢᡗ᠑ᡐᠲᡗᡮᢜᠲ᠒ᡓᠰᡀᠯᡳᡆ᠐ᢛᡮᠧᢢᡜᠾᡖᠠᡰᠵᢁᡔᡁᡔᠿᠽᡜᠿᡖᢤᡞᡎᡱᠮᢠᢜᡮᠧᡮᡖᠪᠼᠱᠠᡍ᠀᠒ᢒᢑᡰᢢᢡ᠑᠑ᡝᡙᡑᢜᡙᡗᡀᠻᠦᠼᠰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":111.83,"y":518.63,"cell":56736,"i":308,"name":"Lingan Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡜᠿᡱᡟᠨᠮᠰᢥᢡᡟ᠐ᠲᠨᠱᢛᡗᡮᡔᢋᠡᠱᡏᡆᠿᢓᢢᢦᢀᡙ᠑ᠯᢛᡴᢤ᠒ᠪᠻᢓᢛᡎᠯᢦᡲᡏᡝᢛᢟᡲᡑᢠᠭ᠀ᡴᢐᡁᡟᠪᠯᡏᢤᡎᡒᡒᡴᡴᡠᡗ᠑ᢟᠠ᠐ᠮᠠᠡᢢ᠒ᡏᡝ᠒ᠲᡒᡜᡆᢀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":216.31,"y":674.43,"cell":74734,"i":309,"name":"Yazhou Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⳃ⳩ⲺⳔⳞⲲⳈⳖ⳧ⳀⳠⲺ⳩ⳢⳬⳢⳬⳊⲾⳚⳚⳲⳘⳐⳲⳐⳆⳒⲼ⳩Ⳣⳁ Ⳍⳬ ⳈⳃⳘⳄⳌⳎⲾⳤⳒⳊⳆⳈ Ⲻ ⳫⳚⳚⳎⳎⳆⳐ⳾ⳆⳆⳔⳞⲲ  ⳄⲼⳐⳒ⳾ⳘⳄⳂⲴ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":414.53,"y":493.62,"cell":53002,"i":310,"name":"Nishira Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \ud802\ud802𐠘\udc02𐠗\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠰𐠸\ud802𐠘\udc2c𐠭𐠃\ud802 \udc15𐠸\udc2d\ud802\ud802 𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠞𐠖 𐠅\udc26𐠄\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠩𐠭𐠓\udc27𐠼\udc28\udc32\ud802\ud802𐠲\udc3c\udc08\ud802\ud802 \udc17𐠼 \udc27\udc1e</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1520.39,"y":466.78,"cell":48688,"i":311,"name":"Menerden Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀጠጸሠ ረፈረገሠሐመዘደበከወተወአጰደለፐ አከጸፈሰደጠዘ  ነ ቀለሠወከ ጰሐፈዐጠደአገሰገደሀፀጸ ለተጠዘዐበፐፀጸ ከሀ ጠለጠየዘረአአወፀቀጠፐበ የከየጰነተ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":759,"y":460,"cell":46962,"i":312,"name":"Soyangdong Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝ᠑ᡝᢜᡖᡒᡞᢦᡳᡟᡀ᠐᠒ᡔᢤᡯᡜᠾᡴᠦᢏᡓᡲᢂᡴᡰᡲᡜᢋᢐᡎᡳᡑᡆᡡᡡᡞᡠᢠᢏᢤᢡᠪᠾᠾᡰᡴᡲᠠᢟ᠑ᡗᡜᡖᠩᠭᡐᢁᡆᡆᢀᠩᡎᢡᠩᡔᢏᡱᡐᠻᡖᡝᢜᡓᠮᢀᠡᢂᢁᡴᡠ᠒ᢡ᠐ᠻᡒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":612.66,"y":1025.61,"cell":98451,"i":313,"name":"Shogirurura Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⲼⳠⳐⳌⲶ⳪Ⳣ⳹ⳜⳀⳠ⳪ⳤⳀⳎⳎ⳹ⲲⳀ⳧ⳁ⳹ⲶⳤⳲⳚ⳹ⳃⳫⳬⳆⳌ⳪ⳈⳀⳔⳒ⳥ Ⳍ⳩ⲴⳀⳒⲴ⳧</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":808.57,"y":673.17,"cell":74780,"i":314,"name":"Tlacapaltelol Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟\udc03𐠷\udc01𐠒\udc35𐠍\udc01\udc02\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠮\udc19\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠷\ud802\ud802𐠳\udc14\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠒\udc37\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯𐠨\udc34\udc1b\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc3c\ud802 \udc2b\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":440.02,"y":374.16,"cell":29965,"i":315,"name":"Zhenlu Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ረአነበቀሀወየሀዘዐ  ለነወዐገ የአተነለአ  ጰጠ ሀ ፈሰሀረጠበሐሀሐደፀ ሀሰጠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":290.69,"y":240.26,"cell":11906,"i":316,"name":"Dashaant Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢐᡱᠲᠡᡀᠩᢦᢠᡭᠾᢑ᠒ᠱᢂᠦᢞᠾᠻᠦᡒᡕᠠᡔᡍᡖᠰᠼᢂᠿᡰᠨᡠᡀᡳᡙᡐᡑᢑᠿᢛᡰᡍᠭᢑᠼᡆᠩᢤᡜ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":217.32,"y":611.9,"cell":68735,"i":317,"name":"Yichaian Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ቀሀተአነዘተቀወረየኀጰተፐረፈሠፈጠገጸሀ ፐየከሠ ጸአ ጠዘተዐ አበፈለየኀፈየደሀበየለበተቀሰኀሠፀዐ ጸሰዘየፀገወሐወገለቀሠለበሰነፀከፀለኀሐጠወወነደኀለሠፈ ጰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":452.65,"y":948.26,"cell":91338,"i":318,"name":"Ghom Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ኀጸአሠጸሰዐአአመተነወሀፈጠ ጰየ ተበከለነጠተጸከየዘዐ ተጸጠ  ጸ የመፐተፀጰሐቀፐተደተ በዘነጸቀነ ሐሠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":256.3,"y":1039.3,"cell":99215,"i":319,"name":"Inverdaberl Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳭⳐⳈⳞ⳹ⳎⳠⳒⳖ⳧ⳘⳤⳌⲲⳁⳚⳞ⳧ⳬⲺⲾⲾ⳾  ⳠⳠⳞⳚⳁⳒ ⳃ⳥⳹Ⳅ⳪ⳃⳢⳁⳬⳎⳁⳬⳒⳘⲸⳞⲶⳖⳊⳎ⳩ ⳚⳆ⳧ⲾⳄ⳩⳹  ⳊⲺⳌ⳹ⲾⳠⳌ⳪Ⲹ⳪ⳒⳠⳃⳢ Ⲵ ⳧ⲾⳁⳚⳭⳌ⳪Ⲷ⳧ⲾⳭⳎ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":328.94,"y":1081.36,"cell":102062,"i":320,"name":"Myona Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠአዐቀጰጸሠዐሠጸፐዘቀመቀሠመአረአደፀ ሠየገከአሠተፈአዐኀመተ ተ ቀሀፀ መተጸኀዐ የሀዘከከሐየፈሀወሠጸዐከጰየመጠገ ኀበመጰገ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":956.07,"y":614.25,"cell":69175,"i":321,"name":"Keathel Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༃༂༗༙༉༪༆༆༱༌༢༗༁༁༜་༉༺༖༯༆༮༃༳༓༫༦༥༧༸༭༮༭༣༚༹༼༡༊༽༓༁༁༻༓༜༥༤༛༆༄༗༛༧༛༊༼༆་༄༧༆༨༦༃ༀ༾༲༡༾༃༆༡༷༿༳༡༧༿༬༌༳༐༅༳</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":585.02,"y":244.9,"cell":12520,"i":322,"name":"Luaiyaowu Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠍\ud802𐠭\udc1e𐠒\udc1c\udc1f𐠃\ud802 \ud802𐠞 𐠖\udc16𐠝𐠊𐠋\ud802 𐠟𐠓𐠫𐠦\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc21\ud802\ud802𐠵\udc22\udc1f\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1155.9,"y":442.34,"cell":44068,"i":323,"name":"Mazagnanoli Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⳬⳌⳆ⳩ⳤⳢⳘⳠⳆⲼⳊⳢⳢⳐⲾⲾⳫⲶⳔⳃⳘⳂ⳧ⳜⳞⳭⳜⳒⲼⳈⳲ⳹ⳠⳂⳄⳭ⳩ⳬⲺⳆⲺⳜⳒⳃⳖⳈⲸⳢⳫⳚⳊⳌⳆⲴⳭ  </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":821.42,"y":476.19,"cell":49908,"i":324,"name":"Seung Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༇༯༻༾༉༑༲༻༇༱༴༐༿༈༌༪༯༒༡༿༦༲༹༪༨༭༚ༀ༺༡༰༙༛༘༃༓༆༶༯༗༹༽་་༐༔༢༅༌༠༯༦༂༄༕༉༕༜༚༴༭༬༑༈༫༮༓</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":338.89,"y":948.46,"cell":91296,"i":325,"name":"Rawala Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">  ሐገደፐተጠነለአለሠጠፀፀመ  ረበወሀአቀሀደተደሰጠጸለዐጠከጸመከገ ደፀበሠ ጰፈኀሐኀከጰከኀሰሀ ጰበሐፐኀመ ኀየሠፀመሰወገሀፀ ገ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1533.93,"y":864.88,"cell":83246,"i":326,"name":"Kululuowa Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ረዐየደፈገፈወወጸጸዐወ  ፈፀለመዘ  ቀገሰገዐየ ወቀረ መነወተተሀጰጠሀወዐፐአፀቀተጰፀበደጠጸሀረ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1412.65,"y":632.87,"cell":71227,"i":327,"name":"Moncigliano Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡏᠲ᠒ᡏᡭᡡᡳᠪᡍᢞ᠑ᡞᠪᢛᡖᡙᠧ᠐ᠩᠲᡗᢥᡎᠼᡱᡝ᠒ᡕᡴᠱᠡᢂᡒᡲᡞᠪᡴᢡᠼᢁᢒᢦᠦᢑᡆᡟᠿᡖᡑᠩᢟᡠᢡᠩᡮᢡᡎᠡᢠᢜᡗᠦᢂᡐᡲᠻᡒᢏᠧᠮᠵᡯᠠᢤᢐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1301.35,"y":528.1,"cell":58545,"i":328,"name":"Durken Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡕᠦᡭᢐᠧᢁᠳᡰᠧᠦᢐᠯᢏᢁᢞᡔᢡᡳᡐᢞᢂᠯᡆᢁᢢᡒᠿᡕᡀᡖ᠐ᠵᠯᡀᡡ᠒ᠨᠾᠾᢓᡯᡒᢜᡟᡞᡁᠲᠰᠽᡰᡯᠨ᠐ᠠᢟᠧᢛᡍᡭᡏᠮᡀᠧᡭᡎᡟᡆᠯᡒ᠀ᡯᠯᢒᢁᢓᠩᡔᢏᢐᡳᡑᡁ᠐᠒ᡔᡠᢞᡜᠦᡝ᠐ᡠᡑᢦᢁᠭᢂᠱᠲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1570.79,"y":474.69,"cell":50161,"i":329,"name":"Llurthalalad Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༜༘༺༴༪༬༲༐༲༷༲༫༠༹༠༺༷༳༌༈༛༸༌༣༊༒༠༫༬༼༽་༙༫ༀ་༯༂༪༤༖༮༂༭༧༫༨༅༕༴༣༚༢༣༬༇༁༷༗༃༊༔༯༨༕༢༳༗༒༾༁༃༚༩༉༃༁༐༾༾༿་</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":325.93,"y":953.26,"cell":91818,"i":330,"name":"Mabernesku Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳤⲺⳄⲺⲶⲺⳲⲴ⳧⳧ⳜⳲ⳾ ⳤ⳩ⲴⲶⳚⳭ⳧ⳖⲸⳖⳚⳞ⳧Ⲳ⳧ⳭⳀⳈⳊⳖⲶⳠ⳥ⳞⳂ ⳚⳎⳊⲲⳠⳄⳒⳔ ⳧ⳈⳢⳚⳃⲲ⳥ⳖⳫⳢⳒ ⳪Ⳉⳁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1066.96,"y":319.59,"cell":20514,"i":331,"name":"Haregen Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc17𐠃\udc1c𐠍\udc0a\udc02\udc30\udc38\ud802\ud802𐠴 \udc2f\udc08\udc02\udc1e𐠴𐠭𐠏𐠂\udc0d𐠃\udc1a\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc28\udc16\udc0f\udc33\udc22 𐠧\udc20\udc22 𐠲\udc35\udc25\udc0d\udc1d\ud802𐠐𐠂\udc2b 𐠤\udc1c\udc34\udc03\udc1d\udc10\ud802 𐠡\ud802\ud802 </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1066.37,"y":331.17,"cell":22126,"i":332,"name":"Rasbach Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳋ Ⳏⳤ⳪ⳫⳊⳆ⳪ⳞⳲⲼ⳹Ⲽ⳹Ⳝ⳥⳪ⳃⳞ ⳂⳄⲾ Ⳃⳁ⳹ⳔⳁⳄ⳪ⳞⳈⳞⳬⳬⳀⳃⳠ⳪ⳌⳞⳈⳆⲴ⳥ⳤⳜⳐⲺⳆⳤⳫ⳧Ⳟ ⲺⳊⳞ⳥ⲸⲸⳞⳆ ⳊⳢⳄⳌⳈⳢⳒⳁⳢⳖⳤⳬⳆⳘⳭⲾⳞⳄⲼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":462.65,"y":1045.45,"cell":99781,"i":333,"name":"Hahakalaipa Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༲༾༅༫༗༿༪༇༗༨༧༠༲༙༬༫༆༔༒༯༊༱༒༾༮༿༹༙༻༇༊༻༰༦༗༫༜༴༼༘༬༢༐༃༌༦༫༷༛༭༽༶༜༅༾༷༊༉༸༹༗༡༭༗་༠༈༽༼༳༡༦༵༲༦༐༚༊༇༔༁༒༼༾༻༅༩༴༳༗༱༦༾༃༜</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":226.39,"y":681.12,"cell":75283,"i":334,"name":"Heining Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠜 \udc1f\udc18𐠣\udc2e\udc20\udc30 \udc04\udc27\ud802𐠣\ud802𐠟𐠘\ud802 \udc28 \udc03\udc14\ud802𐠬\udc05\udc33\udc02\udc03\udc14\ud802𐠍\udc12\ud802𐠦\udc31\udc18\udc05𐠖𐠷𐠏\udc23\udc3f\udc1c\udc0c\udc11\udc28\udc01\udc2a\udc2f\ud802𐠘\udc15\udc29𐠵\ud802 \ud802 \ud802𐠿\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":385.38,"y":382.17,"cell":31508,"i":335,"name":"Mizudomara Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༤༆༫ༀ༯༬ༀ༳༗༺༠༫༬༅༜༫༴་ༀ༾ༀ༑༴༴༃༭༛༡༺༲༷་༵༧༕༇༣༶༷༐༄༅ༀ༵༱༤༨༲</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1625.79,"y":229.52,"cell":11215,"i":336,"name":"Gibil Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc34\udc0f𐠓\udc0d\udc11𐠸\udc31\udc1a\udc16𐠚\udc31\udc2f\udc25\udc12\udc18\udc25\udc22 \udc35𐠛𐠊\ud802𐠙𐠁\udc29\udc16\ud802 \udc1b\udc15\ud802𐠥𐠟𐠧\udc31\udc0d𐠠\udc16\udc25 \udc26\udc23\udc37 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦\udc2d\udc34\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":877.1,"y":742.8,"cell":77461,"i":337,"name":"Eenqi Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༴༰༩༚༖༬༮༆༦༥༠༵༢༒༗༐ༀ༂༂༷༫༵༧༁༧་་༩༂༙༊༗༸༫༪༤༇༤༡༯༧༭༇༉༐༦༱༘༔༭༌༖༶༼༢༒༊༅༄༺༯༮༬༯༲༷་༘༐༬༖༡༽༼༵༈༂༰་༦༪༇༂༮༫</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":446.66,"y":342.12,"cell":23761,"i":338,"name":"Fuzhong Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ወፐዐሰፀከደለጸቀነፐፀነመአገለሐሀዘዐመ ጸሰቀየሰሠገአየከለአረቀሐነከከአ መፈሐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":576.96,"y":153.93,"cell":4104,"i":339,"name":"Gaozhong Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༵ༀ༨༧༨༪ༀ༤༵༡༖༉༘༿༗༿༿༦ༀ༌༕༦༕༵༩༘༅༊༂༸༌༨༄༥༹༲༾༇༅༿༴༱༦༭༳༊༸༪༂༔༄༧༚༾༔༉༘༬༤༚༦༴༄</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":944.8,"y":533.64,"cell":59248,"i":340,"name":"Pyeon Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༽༜༉༴༇༩༿༔༤ༀ༈༊༷༲༚༭༓༈༚༱༭༯༛༴༮༦༐༹ༀ༐༠༺༫༛༃༇༄༬༇༽༲༕༺་༄༩༾༾༯༅༄༕༜༑༼༐༕་༅༓༦༲༙</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":102.82,"y":886.78,"cell":85375,"i":341,"name":"Bac Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༪༛༮༌༰༖༜༸༩༵༪༪༜༹༱༙༠༁༨༿༌༂༳ༀ༵༁༖༹༘༈༰༵༸༰༦༕༹༫༈༕༒༵༂༐༧༰༺ༀ༓༼</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":219.99,"y":884.78,"cell":85419,"i":342,"name":"Ha Cuong Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᡀᡮᢟᠰᡐᡔᡀᢠᢥᠻᡔᠰᢋᠡᠽᠨᡓᡮ᠀ᡞᡴᢦᡗᡓᡍᡗᠵ᠒ᠼᠭᡙᡜᡎᡔᢟᢑ᠒ᡞᢢ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":129.01,"y":1012.12,"cell":97336,"i":343,"name":"Ninh Pha Xu Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༃༫༺༧༘༺༙༺༻༴༬༤༜༥༲༰༵༦༦༆༒༓༗༦༪༾༵༳༙༠༮༩༹༐༺༳༻༁༉༕༦༗༧༖༆༅༌༲༿༨༡༊༊ༀ༁༱༡༣༡༢༹༆༼༵༬༓</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1053.88,"y":320.95,"cell":20506,"i":344,"name":"Rottenin Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༾༹༹༛༑༂༡༶༷༣༊༙༄༶༆༦༢༫༲ༀ༖༕༱༫༄༓༱༈༃༒༬༷༨༼༧༸༢༽༆༐༴༙༗༜༸༕༿༮༡༚༼༿༔༱༯༙༯༄༪༊༰༭༄༙༖༦༺ༀ༤༄༠༖༗༶༑༬༒༇༚༊༹༷༴༻༱༗༇༴༤༁༓༬༔༮༾༌༕</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":793.8,"y":646.22,"cell":72472,"i":345,"name":"Tetlan Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠨\ud802𐠷\udc2a\udc12\udc14\udc3c\udc1c\ud802 𐠴𐠰\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802𐠭𐠘\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc2a\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠱𐠚\udc15\udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠪𐠚𐠄\udc11𐠂</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":400.25,"y":935.84,"cell":90301,"i":346,"name":"Safur Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹⳪ ⲼⳔⳎ⳥ⳁ ⳹ⳃⳤⳠⲼⳊ ⳊⳲⳁⲲⳀⳂ  ⳤⳜⳊⳜⳌⳄⳫⳄ ⳲⲺⳞⲼⲶ⳩ⳎⲴⳂⲶ⳥ⳜⳘ Ⳃ ⳭⳭⳂⳈⳲⳎⲺⳃⳁ⳧ⲶⳚ⳩ⳂⳬⳞⳂⲲ⳧Ⲳ⳧ⳜⳭⲾⳭ⳩ⲼⳄ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":590.3,"y":298.7,"cell":17991,"i":347,"name":"Laizhou Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༸༣༔༉༲༾༪༅༧༁༮༱༃༘༺༻༱༖༚༯༡༑༶༃༂༲༆༲༃༭༮༔༲༃༺༘༭༶༖༡༰༸༽༐༈༪༧༡༙༅༢༥༌༉༣ༀ༅༷༱༙༛</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":858.8,"y":279.81,"cell":16024,"i":348,"name":"Khathiz Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༒༇༹༩༯༰༣༐༃༳༂༐༪༺༑༲༅༉༴༧་༮༻༁༮༛༧༔་༢༅༘༊༶༽༺༮༯༩༊༈༨༸༂༣༌༳༛༵༱༪༣༇༜༬༂༸་༻༪༒༺༔༤༼༕་༦༇༸༩༷༓༂༬༪༈༭༅༂༦༃༾༨༘༷༘༙༩༷༃༢༸ༀ༊</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":235.59,"y":354.24,"cell":26244,"i":349,"name":"Gogihotan Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አገረጸዘዘደወ ከ ረመሠዘ አቀገረደሰደሠሐመነደሀበሐተጠፈሀረዘመሠጸቀበየቀፈሀአሐገደኀረጰጸበረ በደረአቀጠበፀፀነከሐለነሀከነሐተተሀአ ነፐሐሰ ደ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":353.17,"y":431.01,"cell":41241,"i":350,"name":"Fudotomio Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ከፀሰአየሰ ወሀረጸ ሐዘረፀ ዐአፐ  መሀኀፀነመየኀኀበሰከኀበሰጠሐሠከወገወጠጠለ  ደፐፈጸአከ   ገቀከተዐፈዐከበየጸጸፀነፈሠገኀቀሀፀወነዐዘ ሐጸሐጰፀመረነበገዐኀ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1480.87,"y":606.32,"cell":68366,"i":351,"name":"Drog Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc04\udc28\udc24\udc20\udc14𐠥\udc2b𐠏\udc37𐠗\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬\udc01 \udc23 𐠂 𐠸𐠳\udc10\udc25 \ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠸𐠋𐠁\udc0f\udc15\udc05\udc21\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc2a\udc0f\udc04𐠴\ud802\ud802𐠝𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠜𐠑\udc34𐠋𐠡\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\ud802𐠪\udc22\udc38\udc1a𐠒\udc04\udc19𐠃\ud802\ud802𐠍</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":309.96,"y":352.14,"cell":25775,"i":352,"name":"Samokawa Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸየቀገጸጠነአፈሠዐገኀፐየዘአሠዘከረለሠሐሰደነረነነጠለዘፐኀጸሰሀሰፈወሀሰሰደቀፐወዐፈተዘዐተተአቀሀፐ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1359.22,"y":432.33,"cell":42062,"i":353,"name":"Selburg Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༬༱༼༫༛༫༁༖༇༠༊༤༠༽༌༚༕༌༮༇༸༜༷༉༃༦༐༨༌༂༧༆༣༨༠༿༠༤༫༬༱༼༜༓༷༉༯༿༕༢༭༯༵༽༊༘༨༊༴༮༃༚༺༣༒༮༿༆༉༪༧༫༼༢༫༩༤༬༐༔༡༕༗༙</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1289,"y":147.6,"cell":3444,"i":354,"name":"Ruined Fortress","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":130.52,"y":884.25,"cell":85108,"i":355,"name":"Ruined Fortification","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":330.13,"y":1113.93,"cell":104385,"i":356,"name":"Ruined City","note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ru