62,"name":"Dofen Hole","note":"The Dofen Hole. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":371.71,"y":437.42,"cell":42838,"i":463,"name":"Kumakawa Ravine","note":"The Kumakawa Ravine. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1493.3,"y":264.3,"cell":14358,"i":464,"name":"Lendyrmah Fracture","note":"The Lendyrmah Fracture. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":295.96,"y":834.12,"cell":80655,"i":465,"name":"Eratum Cave","note":"The Eratum Cave. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":291.01,"y":918.99,"cell":88570,"i":466,"name":"Eigledfa Cave","note":"The Eigledfa Cave. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":877.74,"y":572.68,"cell":64368,"i":467,"name":"Himmar Cave","note":"The Himmar Cave. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1211.07,"y":399.97,"cell":35416,"i":468,"name":"Hofsfeld Grotto","note":"The Hofsfeld Grotto. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":325.7,"y":937.48,"cell":90273,"i":469,"name":"Penveredi Pit","note":"The Penveredi Pit. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":887.56,"y":365.08,"cell":28502,"i":470,"name":"Doseungsan Cave","note":"The Doseungsan Cave. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1298.59,"y":415.62,"cell":38775,"i":471,"name":"Lahrten Grotto","note":"The Lahrten Grotto. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1608.4,"y":496.31,"cell":53750,"i":472,"name":"Seyran Cavern","note":"The Seyran Cavern. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1418.12,"y":536.18,"cell":59733,"i":473,"name":"Fisch Tomb","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":571.57,"y":1048.73,"cell":99971,"i":474,"name":"Bhalbarpet Necropolis","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1692.75,"y":423.84,"cell":40591,"i":475,"name":"Abravethethe Tomb","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":366.86,"y":852.56,"cell":82009,"i":476,"name":"Ranorumbia Sepulchre","note":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":402.64,"y":207.22,"cell":9344,"i":477,"name":"Tsayanur Tomb","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":532.44,"y":930.37,"cell":89861,"i":478,"name":"Buqrarah Crypt","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1458.18,"y":345.36,"cell":24578,"i":479,"name":"Navelsbach Necropolis","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1325.31,"y":299.2,"cell":18063,"i":480,"name":"Wittenheim Tomb","note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":919.91,"y":295.33,"cell":17790,"i":481,"name":"Drestmyzhs Necropolis","note":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":384.15,"y":218.48,"cell":10202,"i":482,"name":"Sains Cemetery","note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1605.5,"y":873.1,"cell":84179,"i":483,"name":"Kaaulanaia Crypt","note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1431.87,"y":492.72,"cell":52786,"i":484,"name":"Schoberzell Cemetery","note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1408.3,"y":273.9,"cell":15212,"i":485,"name":"Orstad Sepulchre","note":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilig